 q       quit            quit (also Ctrl-C)
 enter   details         toggle the detail pane; pgup/pgdn scroll it
 x       expand          show descriptions, notes and comments in full in the open pane
 space   fold            fold or unfold the selected epic's tasks
 c       collapse        collapse every epic, or expand them all
 f       refresh         refresh now
 ↑↓ j k  select          move the selection; g/G first/last
 esc                     close the open pane, modal or filter
 pgup pgdn               scroll the detail or diff pane












